#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial: visualize and export results"
msgstr "教程：可视化与导出结果"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every run writes ``.json`` logs (see :doc:`quickstart`); fl-sim ships a "
"visualization layer that turns them into publication-ready curves — "
"interactively in Jupyter, or programmatically from plain Python. This "
"tutorial does both: merge a multi-seed experiment into one mean curve "
"with error bounds, export it to PDF, and open the interactive dashboard."
msgstr ""
"每次运行都会写 ``.json`` 日志（见 :doc:`quickstart` ）；fl-sim 自带的可视化层能把它们变成"
"可直接发表的曲线——在 Jupyter 里交互式操作，或在纯 Python 里以编程方式处理。本教程两者"
"都做：把多 seed 实验合并成一条带误差带的均值曲线，导出 PDF，再打开交互式仪表盘。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:12
msgid ""
"The full script lives at ``test-files/tutorial_visualization.py`` and is "
"exercised in CI (everything except the dashboard rendering, which needs "
"Jupyter). Prerequisites: :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment`."
msgstr ""
"完整脚本位于 ``test-files/tutorial_visualization.py``，并在 CI 中被执行（仪表盘渲染除外，"
"它需要 Jupyter）。前置阅读： :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:16
msgid ""
"The reference for all knobs (fonts, smoothing, widgets) is :doc:`viz`; "
"this page is the workflow."
msgstr "所有可调项（字体、平滑、控件）的参考见 :doc:`viz` ；本页讲的是工作流程。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:20
msgid "Get some logs"
msgstr "准备日志"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:22
msgid ""
"The script trains the same FedAvg experiment under two seeds — the "
"minimal \"multi-seed\" setup. Note the per-run ``tag``: log file names "
"carry it, so the two runs cannot overwrite each other (the same reasoning"
" as in :doc:`tutorial-cli-matrix`):"
msgstr ""
"脚本用两个种子训练同一个 FedAvg 实验——最小的\"多 seed\"设置。注意每次运行的 "
"``tag`` ：日志文件名携带它，两次运行不会互相覆盖（道理同 :doc:`tutorial-cli-matrix` ）："

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:33
msgid "Merge seeds into one curve"
msgstr "把多个 seed 合并成一条曲线"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:35
msgid ""
"``find_log_files`` collects the JSON logs; "
"``aggregate_results_from_json_log_with_custom_axis`` extracts a curve "
"(``step`` on x, ``acc`` on y here — any recorded metric works); "
"``plot_mean_curve_with_error_bounds`` merges the curves into a mean with "
"an uncertainty band (``\"sem\"``, ``\"std\"``, ``\"quartile\"`` or "
"``\"iqr\"``). Saving the figure is plain matplotlib:"
msgstr ""
"``find_log_files`` 收集 JSON 日志； ``aggregate_results_from_json_log_with_custom_axis`` "
"抽取曲线（这里 x 轴 ``step``、y 轴 ``acc``——任何记录过的指标都行）； "
"``plot_mean_curve_with_error_bounds`` 把曲线合并成带不确定度带的均值（ ``\"sem\"`` 、 "
"``\"std\"`` 、 ``\"quartile\"`` 或 ``\"iqr\"`` ）。存图就是普通的 matplotlib："

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:46
msgid ""
"This writes ``fedavg-multi-seed.pdf`` next to your working directory. Two"
" things worth noticing:"
msgstr "这会在工作目录旁写出 ``fedavg-multi-seed.pdf`` 。两点值得注意："

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:49
msgid ""
"The x axis is the **cumulative communication count** — the metric :doc"
":`tutorial-first-experiment` dissected. Plotting against communications "
"(rather than rounds) is what makes different communication-efficiency "
"algorithms comparable in one figure."
msgstr ""
"x 轴是 **累计通信次数** ——即 :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` 剖析过的那个量。"
"以通信（而不是轮数）为横轴，才能把通信效率不同的算法放进同一张图里比较。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:53
msgid ""
"With only two seeds the band is a range, not a statistic — use more seeds"
" (just add more ``seed=`` runs; the merging code does not change)."
msgstr ""
"只有两个 seed 时，带子只是一个范围，还不是统计量——多加几个 ``seed=`` 运行即可"
"（合并代码一行都不用改）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:58
msgid "Explore interactively"
msgstr "交互式探索"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:60
msgid ""
"In a Jupyter notebook, the ``Panel`` dashboard does all of the above "
"interactively: it lists the log files it finds, plots selectable metrics,"
" and gives you sliders for smoothing, fonts and figure size, plus one-"
"click export to PDF/SVG/PNG:"
msgstr ""
"在 Jupyter notebook 里， ``Panel`` 仪表盘把上面的所有事都变成交互式的：列出找到的日志"
"文件、绘制可选的指标，提供平滑、字体与图幅的滑块，以及一键导出 PDF/SVG/PNG："

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:70
msgid ""
"Run this cell in a notebook (JupyterLab, Colab, SageMaker, …) and the "
"dashboard renders inline; see :doc:`viz` for a demo animation and the "
"full feature list."
msgstr ""
"在 notebook（JupyterLab、Colab、SageMaker 等）里运行这个单元格，仪表盘就会内嵌渲染；"
"演示动画与完整功能列表见 :doc:`viz` 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:75
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:77
msgid ""
":doc:`tutorial-parallel-reproducible` — make these runs faster (parallel "
"executor) without giving up reproducibility."
msgstr ""
":doc:`tutorial-parallel-reproducible`——让这些运行更快（并行执行器），且不放弃可复现性。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-visualization.rst:79
msgid ":doc:`viz` — the reference for every visualization option."
msgstr ":doc:`viz`——所有可视化选项的参考。"
